WEBVTT

01:35.890 --> 01:40.770
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.539 --> 01:43.979
[Episode 17]

01:45.350 --> 01:46.560
This is the first time

01:46.710 --> 01:48.350
I've ever given a girl a gift.

01:49.430 --> 01:50.630
You cannot refuse it.

02:00.310 --> 02:02.240
Then I suppose I should be honored.

02:02.280 --> 02:02.950
Should I

02:02.950 --> 02:04.880
give you a generous gift in return?

02:05.790 --> 02:07.390
After my mother passed away,

02:08.280 --> 02:09.520
everyone close to me,

02:10.470 --> 02:11.400
those I trusted,

02:12.310 --> 02:13.840
either left or betrayed me.

02:15.360 --> 02:16.400
I've long been used to

02:16.400 --> 02:17.910
hiding how I really feel.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.000
But with you,

02:20.910 --> 02:23.040
I don't feel the need to hide anything.

02:34.710 --> 02:35.620
You know what?

02:36.280 --> 02:37.910
You were the first person

02:39.000 --> 02:40.730
who ever said you'd protect me.

02:41.590 --> 02:43.390
You were also the first to tell me

02:43.590 --> 02:44.680
I didn't have to

02:44.680 --> 02:45.880
lick my wounds alone.

02:46.430 --> 02:47.840
I'm truly happy…

02:53.360 --> 02:54.890
to have met you in this life.

03:09.840 --> 03:11.170
What's gotten into you?

03:11.240 --> 03:12.430
Are you feeling emotional

03:12.430 --> 03:14.360
because of your sister's wedding?

03:17.079 --> 03:18.340
Save these sweet words

03:18.560 --> 03:19.120
for your own

03:19.120 --> 03:20.680
wedding night.

03:23.590 --> 03:24.150
Alright.

03:24.910 --> 03:26.030
It's a deal then.

03:30.770 --> 03:33.500
♪ Arrows skim through fleeting light ♪

03:34.050 --> 03:36.360
♪ In the blink of an eye ♪

03:36.829 --> 03:39.770
♪ Scattering among clouds and mist ♪

03:42.829 --> 03:45.170
♪ I fall off a cliff ♪

03:45.710 --> 03:48.070
♪ My wings, in an instant ♪

03:48.800 --> 03:51.640
♪ Shatter into sand ♪

03:52.520 --> 03:54.240
♪ Who once laughed at frost ♪

03:54.720 --> 03:57.320
♪ Riding across the world with ease? ♪

03:57.940 --> 04:01.280
♪ And who was swept away toward ♪

04:01.910 --> 04:03.690
♪ That muted darkness? ♪

04:04.100 --> 04:04.950
♪ Who once ♪

04:05.180 --> 04:09.740
♪ Melted me with a gaze like a river? ♪

04:11.030 --> 04:16.589
♪ You're the answer in my heart ♪

04:23.050 --> 04:24.790
♪ I have resolved ♪

04:25.400 --> 04:28.090
♪ To ignite a body of sparks ♪

04:33.240 --> 04:33.750
Yixiao,

04:33.970 --> 04:36.640
♪ Like arrows, falling like rain ♪

04:34.810 --> 04:36.340
have you ever thought about

04:36.510 --> 04:38.040
what kind of man you want to marry?

04:37.040 --> 04:42.110
♪ Reaching with burning intensity ♪

05:12.600 --> 05:15.430
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

05:16.170 --> 05:19.420
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

05:20.120 --> 05:21.420
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

05:21.860 --> 05:25.240
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

05:26.680 --> 05:28.870
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

05:29.550 --> 05:33.250
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

05:34.030 --> 05:35.320
♪ The light between your brows ♪

05:35.670 --> 05:37.450
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

05:37.850 --> 05:40.400
♪ That I love the most ♪

05:41.340 --> 05:43.590
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

05:44.190 --> 05:48.070
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

05:47.290 --> 05:50.640
[Happiness]

05:48.520 --> 05:50.200
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

05:50.870 --> 05:55.020
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

06:20.480 --> 06:21.340
Your Highness,

06:22.870 --> 06:24.070
it's getting late.

06:25.070 --> 06:27.070
Do you plan to sit with me until dawn?

07:11.780 --> 07:13.310
Princess, if you're tired,

07:13.430 --> 07:14.690
you may go to bed first.

07:20.960 --> 07:21.830
I know you still

07:21.830 --> 07:23.230
can't let go of Fu Yixiao.

07:23.800 --> 07:25.260
But I believe that one day,

07:25.310 --> 07:27.270
I'll take her place in your heart.

07:29.680 --> 07:30.430
Actually, I've prepared

07:30.430 --> 07:31.510
a gift for you.

07:34.040 --> 07:34.630
Tonight,

07:35.240 --> 07:37.240
I'm willing to help you leave Susha.

07:46.070 --> 07:47.000
What did you say?

07:50.510 --> 07:51.710
No one would expect us

07:51.750 --> 07:53.700
to run away on our wedding night.

07:54.560 --> 07:55.270
With this,

07:55.680 --> 07:57.310
our escape should go smoothly.

07:56.970 --> 07:58.590
[Su]

08:02.160 --> 08:02.720
Do you know

08:02.720 --> 08:04.120
what this will cost you?

08:05.800 --> 08:07.480
If I don't make sacrifices,

08:08.000 --> 08:08.680
how can I ever

08:08.680 --> 08:09.870
replace Fu Yixiao?

08:11.510 --> 08:12.510
Princess Xiyang,

08:13.360 --> 08:14.310
I can give you

08:14.310 --> 08:17.390
the status and honor
befitting the Princess of Zhennan.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.600
But I'll never

08:19.950 --> 08:20.680
love you.

08:24.190 --> 08:25.920
You don't have to do this for me.

08:26.430 --> 08:27.680
I don't want to owe you anything.

08:27.680 --> 08:29.140
You don't owe me anything.

08:29.920 --> 08:31.380
I'm doing this willingly.

08:33.020 --> 08:36.450
[Happiness]

08:49.670 --> 08:51.400
There are too many people here.

08:55.480 --> 08:56.940
Let me take you somewhere.

09:05.510 --> 09:06.320
Enjoy.

09:11.850 --> 09:12.720
Didn't you always complain

09:12.720 --> 09:13.630
that the food at my manor

09:13.630 --> 09:14.720
was too bland?

09:15.150 --> 09:17.410
Today, I'll treat you to some tasty meat.

09:17.440 --> 09:18.870
Is there no meat

09:18.960 --> 09:20.820
at the First Prince's Residence?

09:21.000 --> 09:21.840
The roasted meat at my place

09:21.840 --> 09:23.100
can't compare to this.

09:23.510 --> 09:24.670
The roasted meat here

09:24.670 --> 09:26.470
is the best in all of Yujing City.

09:27.000 --> 09:28.860
But you're hardly ever in Yujing.

09:28.870 --> 09:29.550
How do you know

09:29.550 --> 09:30.840
where to find good food?

09:30.840 --> 09:31.750
I didn't know.

09:32.080 --> 09:32.910
Yao told me.

09:35.120 --> 09:37.180
You specifically asked him about it?

09:43.910 --> 09:44.510
Don't you usually

09:44.510 --> 09:45.910
prefer light food?

09:46.320 --> 09:48.180
Why are you adding so many spices?

09:48.480 --> 09:50.210
You like spicy food, don't you?

09:50.440 --> 09:52.750
Besides spicy food,
you also enjoy drinking.

09:52.750 --> 09:54.030
Aside from garlic,

09:54.200 --> 09:55.530
you're not picky at all.

09:58.030 --> 09:59.290
You remember all that?

09:59.960 --> 10:01.120
When did you notice?

10:01.670 --> 10:02.390
You've been at my place

10:02.390 --> 10:03.480
for a while now.

10:04.440 --> 10:04.870
If I couldn't

10:04.870 --> 10:06.150
even pick up on that,

10:06.440 --> 10:07.970
how could I command an army?

10:09.270 --> 10:10.800
Since you're so observant,

10:11.270 --> 10:12.550
do you also remember what Lu Ke

10:12.550 --> 10:13.880
and Yun Fang like to eat?

10:14.080 --> 10:14.750
They...

10:21.510 --> 10:22.570
Eat while it's hot.

10:22.840 --> 10:24.900
It won't taste as good once it's cold.

10:29.790 --> 10:30.360
How is it?

10:31.960 --> 10:32.960
It's really good.

10:34.870 --> 10:35.320
Here.

10:43.200 --> 10:44.920
You're so thoughtful.

10:45.030 --> 10:45.720
I assume you've cared for

10:45.720 --> 10:47.380
plenty of other women before.

10:49.390 --> 10:49.870
Yes.

10:50.720 --> 10:52.150
I've traveled far and wide

10:52.150 --> 10:53.360
and met all kinds of people.

10:53.360 --> 10:56.020
Naturally, I've crossed paths
with many women.

10:56.440 --> 10:57.240
Some of them

10:57.240 --> 10:58.960
said they wanted to stay and serve me

10:58.960 --> 11:00.750
to thank me for saving their lives.

11:00.750 --> 11:02.000
I couldn't drive them away,

11:02.000 --> 11:03.440
so I just let them stay.

11:04.750 --> 11:06.810
They were completely obedient to me.

11:07.600 --> 11:09.480
Sounds like your years on the battlefield

11:09.480 --> 11:10.740
were a little too easy.

11:11.240 --> 11:12.390
What do you mean?

11:13.360 --> 11:14.720
I've saved quite a few people

11:14.720 --> 11:16.030
on the battlefield too.

11:16.030 --> 11:16.750
Some of them were

11:16.750 --> 11:19.080
handsome, down-on-their-luck scholars.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.480
Like you, I was very kind.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.630
If they wanted

11:21.670 --> 11:23.790
to offer themselves
in return for my kindness,

11:23.790 --> 11:25.270
I brought them all home.

11:25.630 --> 11:26.360
They were perfect

11:26.360 --> 11:26.790
for teaching

11:26.790 --> 11:28.030
Fang and Shunzi.

11:28.080 --> 11:29.750
It saved me a fortune on tutors.

11:29.750 --> 11:31.360
Alright, stop making things up.

11:31.360 --> 11:32.630
I was joking just now.

11:32.870 --> 11:34.550
There weren't that many women

11:34.720 --> 11:36.320
on the remote battlefields.

11:36.870 --> 11:37.960
But I wasn't lying.

11:38.150 --> 11:39.390
Fang told me himself—

11:40.720 --> 11:41.670
I really did save

11:41.670 --> 11:43.080
four or five broke scholars

11:43.080 --> 11:44.140
and bring them home

11:44.150 --> 11:46.410
to tutor the kids in reading and writing.

11:52.390 --> 11:54.030
S-Seriously?

11:54.630 --> 11:56.120
I don't remember any of that.

11:56.120 --> 11:57.650
But Fang wouldn't lie to me.

12:12.550 --> 12:13.280
Stop eating.

12:13.600 --> 12:14.860
I was messing with you.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.660
You actually believed me?

12:20.080 --> 12:22.080
I knew I shouldn't have trusted you.

12:26.720 --> 12:28.650
Why are you looking at me like that?

12:28.750 --> 12:30.270
I'm just thinking about the rumors

12:30.270 --> 12:31.720
that the First Prince of Susha

12:31.720 --> 12:33.510
is ruthless and bloodthirsty.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.140
Looking at you now,

12:35.440 --> 12:37.240
I find those rumors ridiculous.

12:37.440 --> 12:38.360
Not entirely.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.510
Remember I told you

12:40.720 --> 12:41.510
when I was young,

12:41.510 --> 12:42.970
anyone who tried to hurt me

12:43.120 --> 12:44.600
ended up dead by my hand?

12:45.030 --> 12:45.670
Even back then,

12:45.670 --> 12:46.990
the palace was full of rumors

12:46.990 --> 12:48.390
that I was bloodthirsty.

12:49.270 --> 12:50.720
Later, I went to war

12:50.720 --> 12:53.030
and stained my hands with even more blood.

12:53.030 --> 12:54.160
More and more people

12:54.320 --> 12:55.120
came to

12:55.120 --> 12:55.960
fear me.

12:57.120 --> 12:58.120
The common folk

12:58.270 --> 12:59.080
don't fear you.

12:59.080 --> 13:00.080
They respect you.

13:00.510 --> 13:01.480
The Vajra Defender looks scary.

13:01.480 --> 13:03.010
That's why he subdues evil.

13:03.120 --> 13:04.240
Without the commander

13:04.240 --> 13:06.320
of the Feng Battalion
who intimidates the enemies,

13:06.320 --> 13:07.320
Susha wouldn't be

13:07.440 --> 13:08.790
as peaceful as it is now.

13:10.840 --> 13:12.790
It's rare to hear you

13:12.910 --> 13:14.200
praise me.

13:15.790 --> 13:17.250
Of all the people I've met,

13:17.550 --> 13:18.680
you're the only one—

13:18.720 --> 13:19.750
before and after

13:19.750 --> 13:20.750
your memory loss—

13:21.030 --> 13:22.200
who's never shown

13:22.200 --> 13:23.600
even a hint of fear toward me.

13:23.600 --> 13:25.790
Didn't you say
we're the same kind of people?

13:25.790 --> 13:27.050
When two of a kind meet,

13:27.200 --> 13:28.800
what's there to be afraid of?

13:44.420 --> 13:46.880
[Yujing City, Susha Kingdom]

13:49.120 --> 13:49.980
Your Highness!

13:51.000 --> 13:51.860
Your Highness!

13:52.550 --> 13:53.150
What is it?

13:53.530 --> 13:54.720
News from the Princess's Residence—

13:54.720 --> 13:55.720
last night, Her Highness left Yujing

13:55.720 --> 13:57.250
with Xia Jingshi in secret.

14:09.480 --> 14:10.200
Xiyang...

14:11.120 --> 14:12.390
Why would Xiyang leave Susha

14:12.390 --> 14:13.920
with the Prince of Zhennan?

14:14.150 --> 14:14.950
Your Majesty,

14:15.510 --> 14:17.570
I'll send men after her immediately.

14:17.600 --> 14:17.960
No.

14:19.550 --> 14:20.390
First Prince…

14:21.000 --> 14:23.150
Tell the First Prince
he must bring them back!

14:23.150 --> 14:23.600
Yes.

14:30.640 --> 14:31.730
[Jingming Garden]

14:36.000 --> 14:36.910
Greetings, Your Highness.

14:36.910 --> 14:37.910
I failed in my duties.

14:37.910 --> 14:39.210
Please punish me.

14:39.240 --> 14:39.960
Your Highness,

14:39.960 --> 14:40.840
when changing shifts

14:40.840 --> 14:41.870
this morning, they found

14:41.870 --> 14:42.670
the guards on duty last night

14:42.670 --> 14:43.870
had all been drugged.

14:44.360 --> 14:46.560
The Princess and Xia Jingshi were gone.

14:48.480 --> 14:49.440
Everyone leave.

14:50.240 --> 14:50.720
Leave.

14:54.600 --> 14:55.460
Your Highness.

14:56.750 --> 14:57.790
What did the gate guards say?

14:57.790 --> 14:59.120
Around a quarter
past midnight last night,

14:59.120 --> 14:59.960
the Princess and Xia Jingshi

14:59.960 --> 15:02.220
used an imperial token to leave the city.

15:02.840 --> 15:04.270
An imperial token?

15:06.960 --> 15:08.360
Xia Jingshi...

15:09.030 --> 15:11.080
he must be heading back to Jinxiu.

15:11.750 --> 15:12.910
To return to Jinxiu,

15:13.000 --> 15:14.000
the fastest route

15:14.120 --> 15:15.400
is straight east—

15:15.600 --> 15:18.130
through Xishu City,
around Mount Changlong,

15:18.320 --> 15:19.390
then past Guxi,

15:19.390 --> 15:20.790
Liaochuan, and Fengyang

15:21.120 --> 15:22.200
to reach the border.

15:22.200 --> 15:23.910
They left at a quarter past midnight,

15:23.910 --> 15:25.190
so by now,

15:25.270 --> 15:26.270
they're probably

15:26.270 --> 15:27.400
almost at Guxi Town.

15:28.750 --> 15:30.030
I know very well how fast

15:30.030 --> 15:30.750
Xia Jingshi's horses run.

15:30.550 --> 15:31.550
[Guxi Town]

15:32.150 --> 15:33.600
Send word immediately via carrier pigeon

15:33.600 --> 15:34.910
to the guards at all the checkpoints

15:34.910 --> 15:36.720
in Guxi, Liaochuan, and Fengyang.

15:36.720 --> 15:38.980
Tell them to stop those two along the way.

15:39.150 --> 15:40.040
Gu Yu, Yun Fang,

15:40.200 --> 15:41.840
you're coming with me right now.

15:41.840 --> 15:42.750
If we travel day and night,

15:42.580 --> 15:44.920
[Yujing Border]

15:42.750 --> 15:44.280
we might catch up with them.

15:44.440 --> 15:45.010
Lu Ke,

15:45.080 --> 15:46.320
go to the barracks

15:46.480 --> 15:46.960
and gather

15:46.960 --> 15:48.240
a squad of elite riders.

15:48.240 --> 15:49.750
Before they reach the border,

15:49.750 --> 15:50.600
they'll definitely

15:50.600 --> 15:52.270
pass through the bamboo forest
outside Fengyang.

15:52.270 --> 15:53.720
If we don't make it in time,

15:53.720 --> 15:55.600
you'll intercept them there.

16:23.880 --> 16:25.010
I'm coming with you.

16:27.840 --> 16:29.240
I can handle this myself.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.890
Wait for me in Yujing City.

16:32.460 --> 16:33.860
[Feng]

16:32.740 --> 16:33.670
Take this token.

16:34.270 --> 16:34.960
With it,

16:35.200 --> 16:35.750
you can command

16:35.750 --> 16:37.280
all the guards in the manor.

16:37.480 --> 16:38.240
No one will stop you

16:38.240 --> 16:39.900
no matter where you want to go.

16:43.840 --> 16:44.570
Don't worry.

16:53.790 --> 16:55.140
He's just going after Xia Jingshi

16:55.140 --> 16:56.070
and Feng Xiyang.

16:56.080 --> 16:57.610
It shouldn't be dangerous.

16:59.510 --> 17:00.030
Wait.

17:00.840 --> 17:02.030
Xia Jingshi burned all his bridges

17:02.030 --> 17:03.090
when he fled Susha.

17:03.280 --> 17:05.790
He must've expected Feng Suige
to come after him.

17:05.790 --> 17:07.150
Feng Suige is in danger.

17:25.940 --> 17:28.690
[Fu Yixiao] [Feng Suige] [Guxi Town]

17:34.850 --> 17:38.460
[Liaochuan Town]

17:38.570 --> 17:41.040
[Fu Yixiao] [Feng Suige] [Liaochuan Town]

17:52.250 --> 17:54.280
[Liaochuan Town]

18:13.290 --> 18:15.950
[Liaochuan Town]

18:19.200 --> 18:20.270
We asked some travelers.

18:20.270 --> 18:21.070
They just saw a carriage

18:21.070 --> 18:22.030
heading toward the bamboo forest.

18:22.030 --> 18:23.270
It's definitely Xia Jingshi's carriage.

18:23.270 --> 18:25.330
Lu Ke's team should be there already.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.340
Your Highness,

18:35.400 --> 18:36.080
it's them!

19:12.830 --> 19:14.040
Why is he here?

19:25.000 --> 19:27.830
Attack!

20:07.830 --> 20:09.550
Beyond the bamboo forest is the border.

20:09.550 --> 20:10.200
They may have

20:10.200 --> 20:11.160
crossed the border already.

20:11.160 --> 20:11.790
Your Highness,

20:11.790 --> 20:13.050
what should we do next?

20:21.640 --> 20:22.500
Your Highness!

20:25.960 --> 20:27.240
What happened to you all?

20:27.240 --> 20:28.300
Why are you so late?

20:28.510 --> 20:30.350
All our horses collapsed on the way.

20:30.350 --> 20:31.480
We ran for over two hours

20:31.480 --> 20:32.310
to get here.

20:32.400 --> 20:34.600
Someone must have poisoned the horses!

20:35.370 --> 20:37.630
Looks like Xia Jingshi is prepared.

20:38.890 --> 20:40.150
Once they leave Susha,

20:40.440 --> 20:43.240
they'll head straight
for Jinxiu's Zhennan Pass.

20:44.480 --> 20:46.230
[Zhennan Pass] [Beiyan Pass]

20:47.490 --> 20:49.410
They have to pass through
Qixia Valley on the way.

20:48.340 --> 20:49.920
[Qixia Valley]

20:49.920 --> 20:50.850
[Zhennan Pass]

20:51.480 --> 20:52.590
We'll take a shortcut

20:52.590 --> 20:54.070
to intercept them at Qixia Valley.

20:54.070 --> 20:54.790
-Yes.
-Yes.

21:10.550 --> 21:12.280
There's a carriage over there!

21:15.350 --> 21:15.880
Go!

21:21.000 --> 21:21.640
Halt!

21:26.550 --> 21:27.960
This is Susha's border checkpoint.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.000
Who's inside the carriage?

21:29.000 --> 21:30.330
Get out for inspection.

21:46.250 --> 21:48.080
[Su]

21:46.880 --> 21:49.270
This is an imperial token
granted by His Majesty.

21:49.270 --> 21:51.070
To see this is to see His Majesty.

21:51.150 --> 21:52.470
[Su]

21:51.270 --> 21:52.870
Let us through immediately!

21:52.960 --> 21:53.480
Yes.

21:56.070 --> 21:57.070
Let them through!

22:05.160 --> 22:05.690
Let's go!

22:34.880 --> 22:37.200
If we go any further,
we'll be out of Susha.

22:37.200 --> 22:39.330
Princess, you can still turn back now.

22:44.480 --> 22:46.330
I promised to take you out of Susha.

22:46.330 --> 22:47.590
I won't go back on that.

22:48.830 --> 22:49.700
It's just that

22:50.400 --> 22:52.000
I've let my brother down.

23:00.700 --> 23:01.370
Weiran,

23:01.840 --> 23:03.700
Feng Suige won't let this go.

23:04.090 --> 23:05.240
Keep moving at full speed.

23:05.240 --> 23:06.550
We must return to Zhennan Pass
as soon as possible.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.000
Yes.

23:07.920 --> 23:09.050
Go scout ahead.

23:09.440 --> 23:10.480
If anything seems off,

23:10.480 --> 23:11.480
send up a smoke signal.

23:11.480 --> 23:11.960
Yes!

23:28.440 --> 23:29.070
Your Highness,

23:29.070 --> 23:30.550
someone has already
headed for Qixia Valley.

23:30.550 --> 23:31.700
I found a lot of hoofprints

23:31.700 --> 23:33.210
near the valley.

23:36.480 --> 23:38.210
Feng Suige's men must be ahead.

23:38.310 --> 23:39.720
He knows we'll have to pass through

23:39.720 --> 23:41.110
Qixia Valley on our way back.

23:41.110 --> 23:42.510
They must be waiting ahead

23:42.510 --> 23:43.260
to stop us.

23:43.310 --> 23:44.180
Qixia Valley

23:44.270 --> 23:46.270
is easy to defend but hard to breach.

23:46.310 --> 23:47.550
If Feng Suige and his men

23:47.550 --> 23:48.880
are lying in wait there,

23:49.110 --> 23:50.790
we may not escape unharmed.

23:56.320 --> 23:58.140
[Zhennan Pass] [Beiyan Pass]

24:01.330 --> 24:02.490
[Qixia Valley] [Zhennan Pass]

24:02.580 --> 24:04.340
[Beiyan Pass]

24:06.000 --> 24:07.200
Forget Zhennan Pass.

24:07.440 --> 24:08.640
Change course northward.

24:08.640 --> 24:09.680
We'll head for

24:09.880 --> 24:10.680
Jinxiu's Beiyan Pass.

24:10.680 --> 24:11.440
Your Highness,

24:11.440 --> 24:13.480
but Beiyan Pass isn't
part of the southern frontier.

24:13.480 --> 24:14.380
If we go there,

24:14.750 --> 24:16.280
the border troops will only

24:16.350 --> 24:17.810
take us to Shengjing City.

24:18.270 --> 24:20.110
You left Susha without permission.

24:20.110 --> 24:21.720
That's already
disobeying the imperial edict.

24:21.720 --> 24:23.550
If you're taken to Shengjing,

24:23.920 --> 24:25.160
you'll be completely defenseless

24:25.160 --> 24:26.960
with little chance of survival.

24:27.920 --> 24:29.070
If I had a choice,

24:29.960 --> 24:31.890
I wouldn't go to Shengjing either.

24:32.030 --> 24:33.560
But if we continue forward,

24:34.030 --> 24:35.830
Feng Suige will stop us for sure.

24:36.480 --> 24:38.610
Better to take my chances in Shengjing

24:39.160 --> 24:40.620
than be locked up in Susha.

24:42.200 --> 24:42.730
Let's go.

24:43.270 --> 24:43.750
Yes.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.070
This way.

25:50.640 --> 25:52.640
Once we get through the gorge ahead,

25:52.690 --> 25:54.590
we'll reach Jinxiu's Beiyan Pass.

25:54.590 --> 25:56.390
Princess, you can rest easy now.

26:17.240 --> 26:18.440
Feng Suige?

26:21.830 --> 26:22.440
Wait.

26:23.830 --> 26:24.680
If Xia Jingshi suspects

26:24.680 --> 26:26.000
we're lying in wait at Qixia Valley,

26:25.270 --> 26:28.570
[Beiyan Pass]

26:26.510 --> 26:27.870
he'd rather detour

26:27.960 --> 26:29.070
to Jinxiu's Beiyan Pass

26:29.070 --> 26:30.730
than risk being stopped by me.

26:31.310 --> 26:32.240
You and Yun Fang

26:32.310 --> 26:33.680
take your men and head to Qixia Valley.

26:33.680 --> 26:34.270
Gu Yu, come with me.

26:34.270 --> 26:34.680
Yes.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.240
Xia Jingshi!

26:41.880 --> 26:43.430
With me here,

26:43.830 --> 26:45.440
none of you are getting away.

26:57.440 --> 26:57.900
Attack!

27:55.750 --> 27:56.440
Brother,

27:57.680 --> 27:58.790
please let us go.

28:01.160 --> 28:03.350
I'm begging you, just let us go!

28:06.550 --> 28:07.680
Don't come any closer!

28:07.680 --> 28:09.160
Xiyang, put the knife down!

28:09.160 --> 28:09.750
Leave!

28:10.240 --> 28:11.920
Or I swear I'll die right here!

28:15.000 --> 28:16.460
Don't be foolish, Xiyang.

28:17.070 --> 28:17.950
Listen to me.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.290
Put the knife down.

28:19.400 --> 28:20.250
Brother,

28:20.440 --> 28:21.310
all my life,

28:21.310 --> 28:22.770
you've always spoiled me.

28:23.110 --> 28:23.830
Why can't you

28:23.830 --> 28:24.510
let me

28:24.510 --> 28:26.350
follow my heart just this once?

28:26.790 --> 28:28.880
How could you expect me
to stand by and watch

28:28.880 --> 28:30.270
as you're trapped in an enemy country?

28:30.270 --> 28:31.800
His Highness is my husband.

28:31.920 --> 28:32.830
Going back to Jinxiu with him

28:32.830 --> 28:33.960
is only natural.

28:33.960 --> 28:35.310
He'll treat me well.

28:37.240 --> 28:37.880
Xiyang,

28:38.790 --> 28:40.940
I've never begged you for anything.

28:41.070 --> 28:42.530
Let this be the first time.

28:45.270 --> 28:46.730
Please, come home with me.

28:48.640 --> 28:49.110
No.

28:50.790 --> 28:51.720
Xia Jingshi!

28:53.240 --> 28:54.510
If you're a real man,

28:55.030 --> 28:56.240
get out here now!

28:58.790 --> 29:00.270
Stop pushing me.

29:00.550 --> 29:02.400
Do you really want me to die?

29:24.000 --> 29:24.460
Xiyang!

29:24.750 --> 29:25.480
Brother!

29:49.790 --> 29:50.650
Your Highness.

29:51.400 --> 29:52.260
Your Highness.

30:00.340 --> 30:01.200
Your Highness.

30:03.000 --> 30:04.330
Don't hurt my brother!

30:42.590 --> 30:44.030
Brother!

30:52.030 --> 30:52.640
Brother!

30:54.310 --> 30:55.920
If you still see me as family,

30:56.550 --> 30:57.820
let us go.

31:20.440 --> 31:21.350
Everyone,

31:21.830 --> 31:22.480
retreat!

31:27.160 --> 31:28.020
Your Highness.

31:32.880 --> 31:33.510
Stop!

31:36.880 --> 31:38.550
Let them go.

32:04.200 --> 32:05.880
Princess, you'd better think this through.

32:05.880 --> 32:07.770
There's no turning back from here.

32:07.770 --> 32:08.880
If you want to stay,

32:09.070 --> 32:10.400
get off the carriage now.

32:10.400 --> 32:12.330
There's no turning back for me now.

32:12.680 --> 32:13.920
Wherever you go,

32:14.000 --> 32:15.200
that's where I'll be.

33:16.790 --> 33:17.640
Your hand recovery

33:17.640 --> 33:18.590
will take time.

33:19.160 --> 33:20.000
Even though you've regained

33:20.000 --> 33:21.270
some strength in your left hand,

33:21.270 --> 33:23.240
you mustn't overexert it,

33:23.720 --> 33:26.050
or this hand will be permanently damaged.

33:45.750 --> 33:46.610
Your Highness,

33:46.640 --> 33:47.880
Military Advisor Xiao is injured.

33:47.880 --> 33:50.010
Shall we stop ahead to rest for a while?

33:53.310 --> 33:53.840
Alright.

34:15.670 --> 34:17.480
Greetings, Prince of Zhennan.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.260
Your Highness,

34:20.510 --> 34:21.889
these are the soldiers
stationed at Beiyan Pass.

34:21.889 --> 34:23.110
The Emperor has been informed

34:23.110 --> 34:25.030
of your unauthorized
departure from Susha.

34:25.030 --> 34:25.920
Please, Prince of Zhennan,

34:25.920 --> 34:28.580
return with us to the capital
to see His Majesty.

34:33.510 --> 34:34.150
Fine.

34:55.400 --> 34:57.800
I ordered you to guard Yujing City

34:57.820 --> 34:59.510
and watch over the royal villa.

34:59.510 --> 35:00.320
And this is how

35:00.320 --> 35:02.150
you all fulfilled your duties?

35:07.030 --> 35:08.670
How impressive.

35:10.000 --> 35:11.580
Here in Susha,

35:11.670 --> 35:13.630
the Prince of Zhennan comes

35:13.630 --> 35:14.710
and goes as he pleases.

35:14.710 --> 35:16.240
What use are any of you to me?

35:16.760 --> 35:18.130
Your Majesty, please forgive us.

35:18.130 --> 35:19.730
We deserve death for letting

35:19.760 --> 35:21.420
the Prince of Zhennan escape.

35:22.230 --> 35:22.670
But…

35:22.710 --> 35:23.480
But what?

35:24.840 --> 35:28.400
Are you trying to say
I've wrongly accused you?

35:29.190 --> 35:30.120
I wouldn't dare.

35:30.230 --> 35:31.030
It's just that

35:31.230 --> 35:33.230
the Princess had an imperial token.

35:33.230 --> 35:34.750
As a city gate official,

35:35.150 --> 35:36.280
I didn't dare defy it.

35:36.280 --> 35:37.210
What did you say?

35:40.190 --> 35:41.230
The Princess must have

35:41.230 --> 35:43.010
stolen Your Majesty's token.

35:43.320 --> 35:44.510
That's how she was able

35:44.510 --> 35:46.030
to leave Susha

35:46.030 --> 35:47.230
without resistance.

35:48.320 --> 35:50.320
The Princess is young and reckless.

35:50.320 --> 35:52.880
Please don't be angry, Your Majesty.

35:53.840 --> 35:54.770
She actually...

35:55.880 --> 35:56.680
Your Majesty!

36:11.230 --> 36:11.960
Leave!

36:12.400 --> 36:14.230
Or I swear I'll die right here!

36:35.960 --> 36:36.760
You're awake.

36:46.510 --> 36:48.240
You fell asleep here all alone.

36:48.360 --> 36:50.760
I was afraid you'd get cold,
so I made a fire.

36:51.630 --> 36:52.290
Drink this.

36:52.360 --> 36:53.360
It'll warm you up.

37:11.590 --> 37:12.070
Didn't I tell you

37:12.070 --> 37:13.330
to stay in Yujing City?

37:13.920 --> 37:14.850
Why are you here?

37:15.630 --> 37:17.440
I had nothing to do, so I came.

37:18.320 --> 37:19.150
But how did you know

37:19.150 --> 37:19.670
we were heading

37:19.670 --> 37:21.130
for Jinxiu's Beiyan Pass?

37:21.190 --> 37:22.360
After leaving Yujing,

37:22.360 --> 37:24.360
I was heading toward Pingling City,

37:24.400 --> 37:25.360
but on the way,

37:25.590 --> 37:26.030
I saw

37:26.030 --> 37:27.550
carriage tracks
leading toward Beiyan Pass.

37:27.550 --> 37:29.810
I figured it was Xia Jingshi's carriage,

37:29.960 --> 37:30.840
so I followed.

37:33.070 --> 37:34.400
Once they pass this desert,

37:34.400 --> 37:36.460
they'll reach Jinxiu's border soon.

37:38.190 --> 37:39.230
By now, Xiyang is

37:39.230 --> 37:39.800
probably already

37:39.800 --> 37:41.230
on her way to Shengjing.

37:43.630 --> 37:45.000
When our mother died,

37:45.710 --> 37:46.960
Xiyang was only four.

37:48.150 --> 37:49.350
I swore then

37:49.510 --> 37:51.280
that I'd protect her for life.

37:51.960 --> 37:53.510
But now I realize—

37:54.550 --> 37:55.880
no matter what I do,

37:57.510 --> 37:59.280
no matter how hard I try,

38:00.920 --> 38:02.450
it never seems to be enough.

38:05.360 --> 38:07.020
You didn't do anything wrong.

38:08.000 --> 38:09.660
You did everything you could.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.320
It was her decision.

38:12.550 --> 38:13.880
She already seemed off

38:13.960 --> 38:15.590
on her wedding day.

38:16.200 --> 38:17.400
I should've noticed then

38:17.400 --> 38:18.440
that she'd made up her mind

38:18.440 --> 38:19.900
to leave with Xia Jingshi.

38:19.960 --> 38:21.840
If I had stopped her then,

38:22.630 --> 38:23.320
she wouldn't

38:23.320 --> 38:24.650
have ended up like this.

38:24.710 --> 38:26.120
She had made up her mind.

38:26.510 --> 38:28.370
But even if you had seen it coming,

38:28.400 --> 38:30.000
what could you have changed?

38:34.190 --> 38:35.590
All I can do now

38:36.400 --> 38:37.840
is pray she'll be happy.

38:45.710 --> 38:47.170
That's wishful thinking.

38:47.480 --> 38:48.190
Someone who could've

38:48.190 --> 38:49.790
brought himself to kill you—

38:49.840 --> 38:50.480
how could he ever

38:50.480 --> 38:51.680
make my sister happy?

38:52.150 --> 38:53.110
I knew fully well

38:53.110 --> 38:54.190
that Jinxiu would be

38:54.190 --> 38:55.390
a living hell for her.

38:55.840 --> 38:57.100
And yet as her brother,

38:57.150 --> 38:58.280
I could only watch

38:58.280 --> 38:59.480
as she walked straight

38:59.480 --> 39:00.320
toward ruin.

39:01.030 --> 39:03.150
She's the Princess of Susha.

39:04.360 --> 39:05.710
How is she supposed to fend for herself

39:05.710 --> 39:06.840
in Jinxiu all alone?

39:08.400 --> 39:09.930
Whatever the future holds,

39:10.480 --> 39:12.110
at least she's safe now.

39:12.840 --> 39:14.320
The two nations just made peace.

39:14.320 --> 39:15.110
Xia Jingshi

39:15.280 --> 39:16.670
wouldn't dare harm her.

39:22.630 --> 39:23.830
Don't think too much.

39:24.400 --> 39:25.260
We'll head back

39:25.480 --> 39:26.880
to Yujing at first light.

39:28.510 --> 39:29.640
I haven't asked you—

39:29.920 --> 39:31.190
you shot all those arrows

39:31.190 --> 39:32.400
from so far away today.

39:32.400 --> 39:33.330
How's your hand?

39:34.190 --> 39:34.920
It's fine.

39:35.070 --> 39:36.600
I didn't use much strength.

39:37.480 --> 39:38.340
Don't lie to me.

39:39.280 --> 39:40.410
It's too windy here.

39:40.510 --> 39:41.910
Let's go back to the tent.

39:42.590 --> 39:43.190
Let me see.

39:45.670 --> 39:46.560
What's wrong?

39:46.920 --> 39:48.360
Nothing. Let's just go.

39:48.480 --> 39:49.140
Don't move.

39:53.630 --> 39:54.630
It's really fine.

39:55.310 --> 39:56.340
Stop looking.

39:59.110 --> 40:00.560
You call this fine?

40:02.630 --> 40:03.630
It's really fine.

40:04.590 --> 40:05.760
Can you even move your hand?

40:05.760 --> 40:06.880
Don't make a fuss.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.190
It'll heal in a few days.

40:08.190 --> 40:09.320
Did you forget

40:09.320 --> 40:10.320
what Lord Ling told you?

40:10.320 --> 40:11.760
I couldn't care about that.

40:11.760 --> 40:12.510
I couldn't just stand by

40:12.510 --> 40:13.480
and watch you get hurt.

40:13.480 --> 40:14.920
And I can't just stand by and watch you

40:14.920 --> 40:15.590
become a wreck

40:15.590 --> 40:16.400
trying to protect me.

40:16.400 --> 40:17.480
So what if I'm a wreck?

40:17.480 --> 40:18.810
You think I'm a wreck now

40:18.880 --> 40:19.760
and despise me?

40:22.070 --> 40:23.440
Feng Suige, listen carefully.

40:23.440 --> 40:24.360
Even if I become a wreck,

40:24.360 --> 40:25.550
I won't regret it.

40:25.800 --> 40:27.860
Because I've long had a thing for you.

40:33.610 --> 40:35.920
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

40:36.470 --> 40:39.230
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

40:39.660 --> 40:41.940
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

40:41.110 --> 40:42.470
Have you ever thought about

40:42.470 --> 40:45.820
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

40:42.710 --> 40:44.570
what kind of man you want to marry?

40:45.190 --> 40:46.590
What kind of man I want to marry?

40:46.390 --> 40:48.630
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

40:48.030 --> 40:48.590
Actually, that night,

40:48.590 --> 40:49.630
I saw the words

40:48.980 --> 40:52.600
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

40:49.630 --> 40:50.830
on the lotus lantern.

40:51.400 --> 40:52.190
I also wish

40:52.550 --> 40:53.920
I could grow old with the person

40:53.110 --> 40:58.770
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

40:53.920 --> 40:54.760
beside me.

40:56.480 --> 40:57.340
And that person

40:58.280 --> 40:59.030
is you.

40:59.080 --> 41:01.190
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

41:01.000 --> 41:02.110
As much as I hate to admit it,

41:01.690 --> 41:05.420
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

41:03.150 --> 41:04.590
I can't lie to myself.

41:05.760 --> 41:07.500
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

41:07.360 --> 41:08.360
As long as I'm alive,

41:07.900 --> 41:11.730
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

41:08.800 --> 41:09.440
I won't let anyone

41:09.440 --> 41:10.710
hurt you.

41:11.150 --> 41:12.480
Even if I become a wreck,

41:12.710 --> 41:14.480
even if I'm down to my last breath,

41:14.480 --> 41:16.210
I'll never break that promise.

41:18.140 --> 41:21.240
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

41:21.670 --> 41:24.180
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

41:24.980 --> 41:27.880
♪ Even if the wilderness is boundless ♪

41:28.350 --> 41:30.730
♪ We won't separate ♪

41:31.350 --> 41:34.290
♪ In the dark night, I look back ♪

41:34.830 --> 41:37.660
♪ Amid despair ♪

41:38.190 --> 41:40.860
♪ A stick of incense, a drop of tear,
an inch of ash ♪

41:41.450 --> 41:44.340
♪ Gathered and parted, all for you ♪

41:47.730 --> 41:50.330
♪ You and I silently recite ♪

41:54.380 --> 41:56.670
♪ This love will never perish ♪

42:00.710 --> 42:02.910
♪ I search for you, yet cannot find you ♪
